From de659936b6e7a6208679f06edef888a81d7f2e2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:54:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Wiki: /guide becomes /wiki, design system joins it as a tab

The team documents move to /wiki and are labelled Wiki everywhere (top bar,
admin sidebar, experimentation links). /guide, /guide/:doc and /designsystem
redirect with query and section kept. The design system renders as the
wiki's sixth tab, lazily loaded and outside .gd-doc so the document
typography does not restyle live components; its contents list and section
tracking use the wiki shell.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Je1v64McNyB6XEu6gFgM4C
